"U01MYF2N7DM","text":"MRU、これでしょうか？\u003chttps://github.com/yegappan/mru\u003e","ts":"1636982963.021400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"yegappan/mru","id":1,"title":"yegappan/mru","text":"Most Recently Used (MRU) Vim Plugin","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"189","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=6Du"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8FA5CC2D-95EA-47F9-B738-2E0B77F0D94A","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"MRU中心生活にしたのもデカい","ts":"1636982953.021000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E93Og"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74197954-80df-49aa-8ab9-8a667dbd3d58","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どんなバッファが裏で開いているかは一切意識してない、MRU使ってるので","ts":"1636982928.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mX6cU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97B7FC17-78E6-4CBE-AE6B-A1D602BCBA7C","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"富豪的になった","ts":"1636982921.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6UgsH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E528629D-7B1B-4A19-ADC5-89CAD03DCDA2","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"必要なくても残すようになりましたね、\nメモリ食うかもだけどlsとかのがよっぽど食うし","ts":"1636982905.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ZSly"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b506635-800b-4e5e-9793-54b2235f8c4f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分のスタイル上そういう事をしないというだけです、人によって開発スタイル全然違うからなぁ","ts":"1636982898.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PgjX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"832b7f5f-87b0-4b8c-9e76-278f247a9645","type":"message","user":"U01MYF2N7DM","text":"→Github\nありがとうございます！\n→いらないというご意見\nたくさんファイルを開いたけど、もうこのファイルを開いている必要がないとなった場合にはどうされているのでしょうか？","ts":"1636982857.016900","edited":{"user":"U01MYF2N7DM","ts":"1636982870.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nK2hW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"866eb9f5-7cbf-4338-9643-5ef41d85d762","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"開いている buffer を上に表示していると、ごちゃごちゃするのを避けるためにバッファを閉じたくなるので、 `:bd` したくなる気持ちはよくわかります","ts":"1636982855.016800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pOuB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c5942ee-d1eb-47bd-8293-f1efb56a8d0b","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"sayonara がないと辛い体になってしまった。","ts":"1636982850.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CYlJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d72e5a90-136f-4cd9-ac94-551574492604","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私は `barbar.nvim` という Lua 製プラグインを使っているんですが、 `:BufferClose` というコマンドでそういったことができますね\n\u003chttps://github.com/romgrk/barbar.nvim#bbyevim-for-closing-buffers\u003e","ts":"1636982807.013600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"romgrk/barbar.nvim","id":1,"title":"romgrk/barbar.nvim","text":"The neovim tabline plugin.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"768","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Lua","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WBFo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e9b8dbf-1ad7-4e44-a094-a34c0dde5811","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"存在は知ってるけど別に自分は必要ないからな","ts":"1636982798.013300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B4yR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B5C305F-4AA1-4E23-8567-56A9C5049266","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"さよならしばらく使ってたんですけど要らないなってなって消しましたね","ts":"1636982780.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QnY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa2a8916-c946-4202-b7e4-66c3505bccb7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、そうか。ウィンドウを閉じたいんじゃなくてバッファを削除したいんですね (通常だとバッファを削除する必要性が一切ないのでその要求を忘れてしまう…)","ts":"1636982775.012400","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1636982808.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r4zIX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"559d1f95-9830-4b30-8785-a81375f230b3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"かぶりりょく","ts":"1636982734.010900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WS8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d018df21-27b0-405f-bfef-10a2e01c57f7","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"あ","ts":"1636982726.010700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kakko-kabu-tojikakko","count":3,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U013QL1RAPN","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=f+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fcd73e4-948e-4def-8571-34b6103b50cb","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mhinz/vim-sayonara|https://github.com/mhinz/vim-sayonara\u003e","ts":"1636982722.010400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"mhinz/vim-sayonara","id":1,"title":"mhinz/vim-sayonara","text":":japanese_goblin: Sane buffer/window deletion.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"236","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9u+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88615ad2-ff94-4b7e-a50b-6f5e02dd8d6c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とりあえず1つ答えを\n\u003chttps://github.com/mhinz/vim-sayonara\u003e\nこれの `:Sayonara!` はどうでしょう","ts":"1636982658.010100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"mhinz/vim-sayonara","id":1,"title":"mhinz/vim-sayonara","text":":japanese_goblin: Sane buffer/window deletion.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"236","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oYI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f44fd113-ba94-4b8b-adb4-62d28cdf0ba7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なぜ閉じたいのでしょう? 「ウィンドウを閉じる」操作をしたらウィンドウが閉じてしまうのは当然でして…何か別の目的がありそうな気がしました","ts":"1636982587.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a00b77e1-492c-4a38-ad54-a9e527467e62","type":"message","user":"U01MYF2N7DM","text":"画面分割に関する質問をさせていただけると嬉しいです。\n:vsで左右に画面を分割していて、ファイルAを左に、ファイルBを右に、ファイルCを裏で(バッファ)で開いている状態です。ここで、左で開いているファイルAを閉じようと思ったときに、:bd または:bwを実行すると、左右の画面分割が消え、1画面になった状態でファイルBが表示されている(ファイルCは裏にある)状態になります。\nここで、画面分割を維持したままファイルAを閉じることはできるのでしょうか？ファイルAを閉じたあとに、左側半分に表示されるのはファイルBでもCでも構いません。毎回:vsしてwindow resizeする手間を省きたいため質問いたしました。","ts":"1636982493.008100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1uAI"}]}]
